<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#Sx6.SSx6" title="In Appendix ‣ PromptTea: Let Prompts Tell TeaCache the Optimal Threshold" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conflict between Text-Guidance Distillation and CFGCache</span></a></li>
